# Teach in stages

When adding or changing **code** or **infra** in this repo:

1. Ask whether Anadi wants to learn this step (unless they already said "teach me" or "just build").
2. If they want to learn, follow `.cursor/skills/teach-in-stages/SKILL.md`: one stage, check understanding, wait.
3. If they say just build, implement without a lesson, still keep the change small.

Do not explain the whole architecture in one go.
